    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invertinator is a platform game about inverting space and flipping gravity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Invert Space and Flip Gravity</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828570/extras/70314b8b53a4f61cc9fd54de3e061fbd.poster.avif?t=1753278358\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828570/extras/70314b8b53a4f61cc9fd54de3e061fbd.webm?t=1753278358\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828570/extras/70314b8b53a4f61cc9fd54de3e061fbd.mp4?t=1753278358\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Target Times</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For those who like a challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828570/extras/06fc1db4c871d529f3275de96f2f76aa.avif?t=1753278358\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50 Levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snappy and satisfying platformer controls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fun, fast and challenging gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick restarts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Refined level design.</p></li></ul>",
